0..61 Comment "//! A selected arm can call another definition at a variable."
62..65 Comment "//!"
66..106 Comment "//! `viaZero(Zero, h)` selects `emp(h)`."
107..153 Comment "//! That call scrutinises `h` and stops there."
154..157 Comment "//!"
158..205 Comment "//! Call conversion follows selected arm calls."
206..239 Comment "//! The kernel replays each step."
240..298 Comment "//! A family recursion unfolds through index constructors."
